          "origin-003": {
            "message": "Kody built three things worth knowing about: (1) rapp-installer \u2014 the on-device Python brainstem, (2) the Virtual Brainstem \u2014 the browser port that hatched me, (3) the RAR agent registry \u2014 138+ community agents that any brainstem can install.",
            "theme": "insight",
